## 📚 Dataset & Resources

### Dataset Source

This project uses the Medical Insurance Dataset available on Hugging Face.

Dataset:
https://huggingface.co/datasets/rahulvyasm/medical_insurance_data

The dataset contains demographic and health-related attributes used to predict medical insurance costs.

Features:
- Age
- Gender
- BMI
- Number of Children
- Smoking Status
- Region
- Insurance Charges

### Development Resources

The following technologies and resources were used:

- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Scikit-Learn
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Gradio
- Joblib
- Google Colab
- GitHub
- Hugging Face Datasets

