## ⚠️ Disclaimer

This project is for **educational and demonstration purposes only**. 

The model predicts insurance cost risk based on historical data from the [Medical Insurance Dataset](https://huggingface.co/datasets/rahulvyasm/medical_insurance_data). It is not a medical or financial diagnostic tool.

**Do not use these predictions for real-world medical, insurance, or financial decisions.** Consult qualified professionals for personalized advice.

All code uses open-source libraries. No user data is stored or shared.



